                                "sense_id": "42b3564c-9aba-33b6-95ed-8b7c4047d2fb",
                                "text": "Her husband, who had left the room immediately after ushering in the warrior and his sooty burthen, entered as she ws about to speak; and, in answer to her appeal to him, declared that the knight \"could i' no fashion be put up sortably with the like o' them: sorry was he; but welcome should he be to a share of the supper, and a draught at the ale-jug;"
                            },
