                                "example_id": "363f91a6-9ade-480f-88de-5e9363802ef3",
                                "sense_id": "42b3564c-9aba-33b6-95ed-8b7c4047d2fb",
                                "text": "And that peradventure examples in grammar, rethorike, and logike, might more fitly and sortably be taken from elsewhere , than from so sacred and holy a subject , as also the arguments of theatres , plots of plaies , and grounds of publike spectacles:"
